                <head>Letter from the secretary of state, transmitting a dispatch from Herbert H. D.
                    Peirce, agent of the United States in the matter of the whaling and sealing
                    claims against Russia.</head>
                <p rendition="#center">WHALING AND SEALING CLAIMS AGAINST RUSSIA.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">December</hi> 12, 1901.—Referred
                    to the Committee on Foreign Relations and ordered to be printed.</p>

